    {
      "name": "03 - Panne SOAP en direct & Repli Resilience4j",
      "description": "ETAPE MANUELLE 1 : avant la requete 03.1, lancer dans WSL :\n  docker compose stop registrar-clearance-service\n\nETAPE MANUELLE 2 : apres la requete 03.4, lancer dans WSL :\n  docker compose start registrar-clearance-service\n  Attendre que le conteneur soit healthy puis attendre 16 secondes (wait-duration-in-open-state=15s) avant d'executer 03.5.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "03.1 - [APRES docker compose stop registrar-clearance-service] Creer ETU-2026-002 -> Repli PROVISIONAL (201)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201 en repli', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Statut PROVISIONAL_PENDING_CLEARANCE', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.status).to.eql('PROVISIONAL_PENDING_CLEARANCE');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.clearanceToken).to.eql(null);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('defense2Id', body.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"studentMatricule\": \"ETU-2026-002\",\n  \"studentName\": \"Sarra Trabelsi\",\n  \"projectTitle\": \"Orchestration resiliente des soutenances\",\n  \"supervisorCode\": \"PROF-01\",\n  \"presidentCode\": \"PROF-04\",\n  \"rapporteurCode\": \"PROF-05\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/defenses",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "defenses"]
